{'symbol': 'HPQ', 'date': '2023-03-17 10:00:00', 'title': 'BROOK + WHITTLE TO INSTALL FIRST HP INDIGO V12 DIGITAL PRESS IN US', 'text': 'GUILFORD, CONN. , MARCH 17, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BROOK + WHITTLE, A LEADER IN SUSTAINABLE PACKAGING, COMPLEX DECORATION, AND DIGITAL PRINTING, IS PROUD TO ANNOUNCE THE INSTALLATION OF THE FIRST HP INDIGO V12 DIGITAL PRESS IN THE UNITED STATES.'}